  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The height of the point B is<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> <mo>m</mo> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>tan</mo> <mn>3</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mo>&#8728;</mo> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> <mo>m</mo> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mo>m</mo> </mrow> </math><br /><br />The energy of the block at B is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>KE</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>PE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>Mg</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>m</mo></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />The energy at the block at C is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>KE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br />The principle of conservation of energy gives<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>m</mo></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />This gives <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>V</mtext><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Therefore, the choice (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>5</mn></msqrt><msup><mtext>&#160;&#160;m&#160;s</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) is correct.",
